{"text":"care for his child. I'm trying to unlearn many of the lessons of gender that I internalized when I was growing up. But I sometimes still feel very vulnerable in the face of gender expectations. The first time I taught a writing class in graduate school, I was worried. I wasn't worried about the material I would teach because I was well prepared and I was going to teach what I enjoyed teaching. Instead, I was worried about what's where. I wanted to be taken seriously. I knew that because I was female, I would automatically have to prove my worth. And I was worried that if I looked too feminine, I would not be taken seriously. I really wanted to wear my shiny lip gloss and my girly skirt.","words":[{"text":"care","start":0.0,"end":0.7},{"text":"for","start":0.7,"end":0.88},{"text":"his","start":0.88,"end":1.02},{"text":"child","start":1.02,"end":1.42,"punct":"."},{"text":"I'm","start":4.74,"end":5.22},{"text":"trying","start":5.22,"end":5.62},{"text":"to","start":5.62,"end":5.88},{"text":"unlearn","start":5.88,"end":6.54},{"text":"many","start":6.54,"end":6.92},{"text":"of","start":6.92,"end":7.08},{"text":"the","start":7.08,"end":7.2},{"text":"lessons","start":7.2,"end":7.5},{"text":"of","start":7.5,"end":7.7},{"text":"gender","start":7.7,"end":8.0},{"text":"that","start":8.0,"end":8.26},{"text":"I","start":8.26,"end":8.44},{"text":"internalized","start":8.44,"end":9.16},{"text":"when","start":9.16,"end":9.34},{"text":"I","start":9.34,"end":9.46},{"text":"was","start":9.46,"end":9.58},{"text":"growing","start":9.58,"end":9.82},{"text":"up","start":9.82,"end":10.22,"punct":"."},{"text":"But","start":10.4,"end":10.54},{"text":"I","start":10.54,"end":10.64},{"text":"sometimes","start":10.64,"end":11.0},{"text":"still","start":11.0,"end":11.84},{"text":"feel","start":11.84,"end":12.06},{"text":"very","start":12.06,"end":12.26},{"text":"vulnerable","start":12.26,"end":12.64},{"text":"in","start":12.64,"end":12.92},{"text":"the","start":12.92,"end":13.02},{"text":